<div id="saxony" style="width:500px; height:250px;"></div>



- @coalition_saxony: Coalition
- @toleration_saxony: Toleration
- @policies_saxony: Policies
- @states: Exit Saxony



@coalition_saxony
choose-if: saxony_spd == 1
unavailable-subtitle: We are not part of the Coalition
go-to: saxony_state

This is where some new arrangments would be possible, some day

@toleration_saxony
choose-if: saxony_spd == 2
unavailable-subtitle: We are not in toleration


@policies_saxony
choose-if: saxony_spd == 1 and saxony_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not saxony_spd == 1: We are not part of the Coalition. ?][? if saxony_spd == 1 and saxony_action_timer > 0: We have to wait [+ saxony_action_timer +] months before our next action. ?]



- @reform_the_administration
- @protect_left
- @fund_workers_militias
- @subsidize_printing
- @give_tax_breaks_to_local_buisnesses


@reform_the_administration
title: Reform the administration of Saxony
subtitle: Most of the aspects of the Saxon state administration still have an anti-worker bias.
view-if: saxony_reform < 7
on-arrival: saxony_reform += 1; saxony_action_timer += 7; saxony_jud += 1
go-to: saxony_state

@protect_left
title: Protect Communist and Anarchist organisations
subtitle: The burocracy has largely been biased against the left
unavailable-subtitle: [? if saxony_reform < 3: The administration won't let this happen. ?][? if saxony_ddp == 2: The DDP would withdraw its toleration ?]
choose-if: saxony_reform >= 3 and (saxony_gov == "SPD" or saxony_gov == "Social-Democratic" or saxony_gov == "Left") and not saxony_ddp == 2
on-arrival:  saxony_action_timer += 8; saxony_jud += 0.5; kpd_relation += 4; sb_relation += 6; uspd_relation += 4; unemployed_kpd += 1; anarchist_media += 0.3; communist_media += 0.3
go-to: saxony_state

We have revised a few prison terms and unbanned some periodicals.

@fund_workers_militias
title: Fund worker's militias
subtitle: There are some worker's militas, often aligned with the KPD.
on-arrival: rfb_strength += 1; kpd_relation += 5; saxony_action_timer += 8; ddp_relation -= 3; z_relation -= 1; dvp_relation -= 4
choose-if: saxony_gov == "SPD" or saxony_gov == "Social-Democratic" or saxony_gov == "Left" and not saxony_ddp == 2
go-to: saxony_state

@subsidize_printing
title: Subsidize the printing industry
subtitle: We could give handouts to liberal publishing houses.
on-arrival: liberal_media += 0.5; other_media += 1; ddp_relation += 3; new_middle_spd += 2; conservative_media -= 0.4; old_middle_spd += 1; workers_spd += 1; saxony_action_timer += 10
go-to: saxony_state

@give_tax_breaks_to_local_buisnesses
title: Give tax breaks to local buisnesses
subtitle: The Bourgeois will love this.
on-arrival: ddp_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 5; old_middle_spd += 3; workers_spd -= 2; saxony_action_timer += 9; saxony_action_timer -= 2 if saxony_dvp == 1
choose-if: not (saxony_kpd >= 1 or saxony_uspd >= 1 or saxony_sapd >= 1)
go-to: saxony_state














